<title>GERMANY: TABLE-German May capital account in surplus-Buba.</title>
<headline>TABLE-German May capital account in surplus-Buba.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German capital account swung into a provisional 13.4 billion mark surplus in May compared with a deficit of 2.0 billion marks in April, the Bundesbank said.</p>
<p>In the first five months of 1997, the capital account showed a surplus of 25.3 billion marks compared with a surplus of 30.5 billion marks in the same months in 1996.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank issued the following trade and capital account data (in billion marks)</p>
<p>				     May	 April</p>
<p>Capital account		 +13.4	-2.0</p>
<p>Current account		 -2.5	 +3.1</p>
<p>Trade			     +9.8	 +10.4</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
